---
description: Shared Hermes/Shift platform rules — affected-agent analysis required
globs:
  - src/platform/*.py
  - src/platform/scripts/**
  - src/platform/systemd/**
  - src/plugins/**
  - src/agents/shift/skills/dispatch_shift_agent/**
  - src/agents/shift/scripts/**
  - src/agents/shift/systemd/**
alwaysApply: false
---

Read and enforce `docs/governance/shared-platform-directive.md` in addition to
the universal directive.

A change here reaches every agent on the VPS. It must carry affected-agent
analysis, compatibility proof, default behavior, activation posture, rollback,
per-agent impact and tests for every materially affected product.

Do not add a parallel router, audit path, approval-code generator or send gate.
Do not absorb product-specific business policy into a shared component.
